<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's JSE suspends Tigon Ltd shares.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's JSE suspends Tigon Ltd shares.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said it had suspended the listing of Tigon shares from the start of business on Wednesday due to a breach of listing requirements.  </p>
<p>The exchange said the suspension decision was taken pending publication of an announcement by Tigon relating to a substantial source of its earnings as disclosed in abridged results for the year to January published on May 6.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
